msgid "[Prescriptions through the eHealthBox](medicaments-ehealthbox.md)"
msgstr "[Les ordonnances par l'eHealthBox](medicaments-ehealthbox.md)"

#: ../../content/belgique/medicaments-lien-pharmacie.md:170
msgid "[Billing medicines in Belgium](medicaments-facturation.md)"
msgstr "[Facturer les médicaments en Belgique](medicaments-facturation.md)"
